  "In schlechteren Stellungen bricht {n} schnell ein ({detail}). Sobald du besser stehst: weiter angreifen und Druck halten, statt nur abzusichern.": "{n} collapses quickly in worse positions ({detail}). As soon as you are better: keep attacking and keep up the pressure instead of just playing safe.",
